#!markdown

# 06 · Backtesting

**English.** A backtest replays history through a strategy with realistic fills and costs. `Finance.Backtesting` offers an event-driven engine (Zipline/Backtrader style: orders fill on the next bar, with commission and slippage models), a vectorised backtester for fast research, parameter sweeps, walk-forward optimisation to fight overfitting, and multi-asset portfolio rebalancing.

**Bahasa Indonesia.** Backtest memutar ulang data historis melalui sebuah strategi dengan eksekusi dan biaya yang realistis. `Finance.Backtesting` menyediakan mesin berbasis event (gaya Zipline/Backtrader: order dieksekusi pada bar berikutnya, dengan model komisi dan slippage), backtester tervektorisasi untuk riset cepat, penyapuan parameter, optimisasi walk-forward untuk melawan overfitting, serta rebalancing portofolio multi-aset.

> Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil

#!csharp

#i "nuget: ../artifacts/packages"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Core, 0.7.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Backtesting, 0.7.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Portfolio, 0.7.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Visualization, 0.7.0"

using Finance.Core.Market;
using Finance.Backtesting;
using Finance.Backtesting.Strategies;
using Finance.Portfolio;
using Finance.Visualization;

var bars = SyntheticMarket.GeometricBrownianBars(1500, startPrice: 100, annualDrift: 0.09, annualVolatility: 0.24, seed: 99);
var settings = new BacktestSettings
{
    InitialCash = 100_000,
    Commission = CommissionModels.PerShare(0.005, minimum: 1),
    Slippage = SlippageModels.FixedBps(2),
};
var engine = new BacktestEngine(settings);

#!markdown

## Event-driven strategies / Strategi berbasis event

**EN.** Each strategy sees one bar at a time and can only trade on information it has already seen; orders fill at the next bar's open. We compare four built-in strategies against buy-and-hold, after costs.

**ID.** Setiap strategi melihat satu bar setiap kali dan hanya dapat bertransaksi berdasarkan informasi yang sudah terlihat; order dieksekusi pada harga pembukaan bar berikutnya. Kita membandingkan empat strategi bawaan terhadap buy-and-hold, setelah biaya.

#!csharp

var strategies = new Strategy[]
{
    new BuyAndHoldStrategy(),
    new SmaCrossoverStrategy(20, 100),
    new RsiMeanReversionStrategy(14, 30, 70),
    new BollingerBreakoutStrategy(20, 2),
};
var results = strategies.Select(s => engine.Run(s, "DEMO", bars)).ToList();
Console.WriteLine($"{"Strategy",-36} {"Return",8} {"CAGR",7} {"Sharpe",7} {"MaxDD",8} {"Trades",6} {"Win%",6}");
foreach (var r in results)
{
    var st = r.Statistics;
    Console.WriteLine($"{r.StrategyName,-36} {st.TotalReturn,8:P1} {st.Cagr,7:P1} {st.SharpeRatio,7:F2} {st.MaxDrawdown,8:P1} {st.NumberOfTrades,6} {st.WinRate,6:P0}");
}
var dates = results[0].Times;
display(HTML(Charts.Line(results.Select(r => new LineSeries(r.StrategyName, r.Equity)).ToList(),
    new ChartOptions { Title = "Equity curves after costs", YFormat = "N0", Height = 380 }, dates)));

#!markdown

## Trades on the chart / Transaksi pada grafik

**EN.** Round trips are recorded with entry, exit, P&L and commission, and can be drawn on the candles.

**ID.** Setiap transaksi pulang-pergi dicatat dengan harga masuk, keluar, laba-rugi dan komisi, dan dapat digambar di atas candlestick.

#!csharp

var sma = results[1];
foreach (var t in sma.Trades.Take(5))
    Console.WriteLine($"{t.EntryTime:yyyy-MM-dd} → {t.ExitTime:yyyy-MM-dd}  {t.Quantity,6:F0} @ {t.EntryPrice,7:F2} → {t.ExitPrice,7:F2}  P&L {t.Pnl,10:N2} ({t.ReturnPct:P1})");
var index = bars.Select((b, i) => (b.Time, i)).ToDictionary(x => x.Time, x => x.i);
var markers = sma.Fills.Where(f => index.ContainsKey(f.Time)).Select(f => new TradeMarker(index[f.Time], f.Price, f.Side)).ToList();
display(HTML(Charts.Candlestick(bars[^300..], new ChartOptions { Title = "SMA 20/100 fills (last 300 bars)", Height = 380 },
    trades: markers.Where(m => m.Index >= bars.Length - 300).Select(m => m with { Index = m.Index - (bars.Length - 300) }).ToList())));

#!markdown

## Parameter sweep and walk-forward / Penyapuan parameter dan walk-forward

**EN.** Picking the best parameters on all of history is overfitting. Walk-forward optimisation chooses parameters on a rolling in-sample window and only scores them on the following out-of-sample window; the stitched out-of-sample equity is the honest estimate.

**ID.** Memilih parameter terbaik dari seluruh data historis adalah overfitting. Optimisasi walk-forward memilih parameter pada jendela in-sample yang bergulir dan hanya menilainya pada jendela out-of-sample berikutnya; ekuitas out-of-sample yang digabungkan adalah estimasi yang jujur.

#!csharp

var data = new Dictionary<string, Bar[]> { ["DEMO"] = bars };
var grid = ParameterSweep.Grid(new[] { 10, 20, 50 }, new[] { 100, 150, 200 });
var sweep = ParameterSweep.Run(grid, p => new SmaCrossoverStrategy(p.Item1, p.Item2), data, settings);
foreach (var s in sweep.OrderByDescending(s => s.Score).Take(3))
    Console.WriteLine($"in-sample best: SMA {s.Parameters.Item1}/{s.Parameters.Item2}  Sharpe {s.Score:F2}");

var wfo = new WalkForwardOptimizer<(int, int)>(grid, p => new SmaCrossoverStrategy(p.Item1, p.Item2), settings);
var wf = wfo.Run(data, inSampleBars: 500, outOfSampleBars: 125);
Console.WriteLine($"Walk-forward: {wf.Windows.Count} windows, out-of-sample Sharpe {wf.Statistics.SharpeRatio:F2}, return {wf.Statistics.TotalReturn:P1}");

#!markdown

## Vectorised research / Riset tervektorisasi

**EN.** For quick idea screening, positions can be computed as arrays and evaluated in one pass, vectorbt-style.

**ID.** Untuk menyaring ide dengan cepat, posisi dapat dihitung sebagai array dan dievaluasi dalam satu langkah, ala vectorbt.

#!csharp

var close = bars.Select(b => b.Close).ToArray();
var positions = VectorizedBacktester.CrossoverPositions(close, 20, 100);
var vec = VectorizedBacktester.Run(close, positions, costBps: 5);
Console.WriteLine($"Vectorised SMA 20/100: return {vec.Statistics.TotalReturn:P1}, Sharpe {vec.Statistics.SharpeRatio:F2}, turnover {vec.Turnover.Sum():F1}");

#!markdown

## Portfolio backtest with HRP / Backtest portofolio dengan HRP

**EN.** `PortfolioBacktester` rebalances monthly to weights returned by any delegate. Plugging in Hierarchical Risk Parity from `Finance.Portfolio` takes one lambda.

**ID.** `PortfolioBacktester` melakukan rebalancing bulanan ke bobot yang dihasilkan oleh delegate apa pun. Memasang Hierarchical Risk Parity dari `Finance.Portfolio` hanya membutuhkan satu lambda.

#!csharp

var universe = new Dictionary<string, Bar[]>();
string[] names = { "EQ", "TECH", "BOND", "GOLD" };
double[] mus = { 0.08, 0.12, 0.03, 0.05 }, sigmas = { 0.16, 0.28, 0.06, 0.15 };
for (int i = 0; i < names.Length; i++)
    universe[names[i]] = SyntheticMarket.GeometricBrownianBars(1000, 100, mus[i], sigmas[i], seed: (ulong)(10 + i));

var hrpResult = PortfolioBacktester.Run(universe, req =>
{
    var w = HierarchicalRiskParity.OptimizeFromReturns(req.Returns(), req.Assets).Weights;
    return req.Assets.Select((a, i) => (a, w[i] * 0.99)).ToDictionary(x => x.a, x => x.Item2);
}, lookback: 120, frequency: RebalanceFrequency.Monthly, settings: settings, name: "HRP monthly");
var ewResult = PortfolioBacktester.Run(universe, PortfolioBacktester.EqualWeight(), lookback: 120, settings: settings, name: "Equal weight");
Console.WriteLine(hrpResult);
Console.WriteLine(ewResult);

var report = Tearsheet.Build("HRP monthly rebalance", hrpResult.Times[1..], hrpResult.Returns(), ewResult.Returns());
Directory.CreateDirectory("output");
report.Save("output/06_hrp_tearsheet.html");
Console.WriteLine("Tearsheet written to output/06_hrp_tearsheet.html");
